  "$comment": "The bridge from Historia to the simulation. Every tag in taxonomy.json that has gameplay meaning maps to resource deltas here, so a newly ingested event becomes playable without anyone hand-authoring it. Deltas are per-event and scaled by the event's `magnitude`.",
